Cap'n pure-C runtime is **not** vendored here.

Build/link against the **c-capnproto** package (libcapnp_c, pkg-config
name `c-capnproto`) from rg-forge / conda-forge lineage:
https://github.com/HaoZeke/c-capnproto

Schema codegen: `capnp` + `capnpc-c` from that stack; cmocka for tests.
Meson: `dependency('c-capnproto')`.

No nng in this package: Cap'n is in-process FFI, not a socket peer.
